        {
          "text": " Jennaani anini Ilme Hoola ta beesisa jaeeso ch'absitu arge. Lafti guddo chochoote, aduuni aka hagogo guratofte, jii aka d'iiga diimate; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.12",
